---
description: Canonical RacoAI GitHub repository and separate task branches
alwaysApply: true
---

Use https://github.com/RACOAI-Official/raco-erxes.git as origin.
Follow the repository and branch workflow in the root AGENTS.md.
Create a separate codex/<task> branch from current origin/main for each update.
Push to origin on that task branch. Do not push directly to main.
Do not push to the previous raco remote unless explicitly requested.
Merge pull requests only when the user explicitly asks.
